    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years into their marriage, the Kajiuras finally try to have a child only to find that they can\u2019t. Knowing that things can\u2019t continue on like this, Kouki decides to do some research and comes across a relationship seminar. After successfully cajoling his wife Risa into attending and hearing the lecturers\u2019 speeches, even she comes around to thinking that this may work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When they meet the Sonodas at one of the seminar\u2019s group sessions, the Kajiuras find themselves opening up to them about their problems and become close enough to start hanging out outside of the seminar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a session weeks in where the two couples go on a double date puts them all on the path to doing it more and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A touching visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E-mote animated character sprites</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224670/extras/920b05b688ae296d5cb7e969230a5a80.avif?t=1747098025\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risa Kajiura</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ayane Kizaki</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019s cheerful and considerate but has somewhat lost interest in her husband and these days she\u2019s been feeling more and more guilty about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224670/extras/4f6dda3f07e1f4e7fc38bc48f28e7bc9.avif?t=1747098025\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kouki Kajiura</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s a middle manager at a trading company who focused so much on work that he almost let having children slip through his fingers. Although, now that he\u2019s trying for one, it\u2019s just not happening...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224670/extras/6bbb117abc3339734d5bce0829edcde7.avif?t=1747098025\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shiho Sonoda</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wako Ichihara</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has a charming and gentle aura about her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224670/extras/48b20273c246d4b7862f9d7cf2704200.avif?t=1747098025\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yousuke Sonoda</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A freelance writer for websites.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >STORY </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Years into their marriage, the Kajiuras finally try to have a child only to find that they can\u2019t. Knowing that things can\u2019t continue on like this, Kouki decides to do some research and comes across a relationship seminar. After successfully cajoling his wife Risa into attending and hearing the lecturers\u2019 speeches, even she comes around to thinking that this may work.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When they meet the Sonodas at one of the seminar\u2019s group sessions, the Kajiuras find themselves opening up to them about their problems and become close enough to start hanging out outside of the seminar.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >However, a session weeks in where the two couples go on a double date puts them all on the path to doing it more and more.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >FEATURES</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A touching visual novel</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Japanese voice acting</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >E-mote animated character sprites</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CHARACTERS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224670/extras/920b05b688ae296d5cb7e969230a5a80.avif?t=1747098025\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Risa Kajiura</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Ayane Kizaki</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She\u2019s cheerful and considerate but has somewhat lost interest in her husband and these days she\u2019s been feeling more and more guilty about it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224670/extras/4f6dda3f07e1f4e7fc38bc48f28e7bc9.avif?t=1747098025\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Kouki Kajiura</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >He\u2019s a middle manager at a trading company who focused so much on work that he almost let having children slip through his fingers. Although, now that he\u2019s trying for one, it\u2019s just not happening...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224670/extras/6bbb117abc3339734d5bce0829edcde7.avif?t=1747098025\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Shiho Sonoda</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Wako Ichihara</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >She has a charming and gentle aura about her.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3224670/extras/48b20273c246d4b7862f9d7cf2704200.avif?t=1747098025\" width=616 height=230 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yousuke Sonoda</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A freelance writer for websites.</p>",
    "short_description": "In this visual novel with E-mote animated sprites by veteran studio ANIM, after trying and failing to have children, the Kajiuras decided to attend a relationship seminar to fix the problem. There they meet the Sonadas and as the sessions continue, their lives begin to entwine more and more...",
